{"id":6176,"date":"2021-03-31T10:31:41","date_gmt":"2021-03-31T09:31:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=6176"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:01:49","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:01:49","slug":"ems-grande-conference-citoyenne-sante-climat-quelles-solutions-de-mobilite","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/ems-grande-conference-citoyenne-sante-climat-quelles-solutions-de-mobilite\/","title":{"rendered":"[ EMS ] Grande Conf\u00e9rence citoyenne \u00abSant\u00e9, Climat, quelles solutions de mobilit\u00e9 ?\u00bb"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>La qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019air repr\u00e9sente un enjeu de sant\u00e9 publique majeur, en premier lieu dans les m\u00e9tropoles\u00a0: le transport routier y joue un r\u00f4le direct sur le niveau de pollution des territoires, impactant votre\u00a0sant\u00e9.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<p>Pour \u00eatre en conformit\u00e9 avec les l\u00e9gislations europ\u00e9enne et fran\u00e7aise et respecter les normes de qualit\u00e9, l\u2019Eurom\u00e9tropole instaurera \u00e0 compter du 1er janvier 2022, une Zone \u00e0 Faibles \u00c9missions. <b>Consultez la\u00a0vid\u00e9o consacr\u00e9e<\/b>\u00a0\u00e0 la ZFE <a href=\"https:\/\/we.tl\/t-YLKDwNQ0OQ\"><strong>via ce lien<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<div class=\"hat\">\n<div><strong>\u00c0 partir du 10 mai, participez \u00e0 la concertation citoyenne<\/strong> sp\u00e9cialement consacr\u00e9e aux enjeux de sant\u00e9, de climat et de mobilit\u00e9s pour \u00e9changer, dialoguer et construire ensemble les solutions de mobilit\u00e9 alternatives, les aides et l\u2019accompagnement n\u00e9cessaire pour agir concr\u00e8tement. <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourg.eu\/zfe-concertation\">Inscrivez-vous maintenant via ce lien<\/a>.<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>Au programme :<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<ul>\n<li>l&rsquo;information sur\u00a0les impact du trafic routier sur notre sant\u00e9;<\/li>\n<li>qu&rsquo;est-ce que la\u00a0Zone \u00e0 Faibles \u00c9mission et\u00a0ses modalit\u00e9s de\u00a0mise en \u0153uvre (ZFE);<\/li>\n<li>des solutions alternatives et aides disponibles via la page\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/www.zfe.strasbourg.eu\/\">www.zfe.strasbourg.eu<\/a>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Consultez la\u00a0vid\u00e9o de pr\u00e9sentation<\/b>\u00a0du programme de concertation\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/dai.ly\/x806tu0\"><strong>via ce lien<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p>La qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019air est un enjeu de sant\u00e9 publique.<br \/>\nPour toute information sur la zone \u00e0 faibles \u00e9missions de l\u2019Eurom\u00e9tropole\u00a0(ZFE),<br \/>\n&#8211; un num\u00e9ro vert +33 (0) 800\u00a0100\u00a0267<br \/>\n&#8211; et le site\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/zfe.strasbourg.eu\">zfe.strasbourg.eu <\/a><br \/>\nsont \u00e0 votre disposition.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-6179\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir-722x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"722\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir-722x1024.png 722w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir-211x300.png 211w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir-768x1089.png 768w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir-300x426.png 300w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir-1008x1430.png 1008w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir-78x110.png 78w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir-94x133.png 94w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Qualit\u00e9-de-lair-il-est-temps-dagir.png 1204w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 722px) 100vw, 722px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>La qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019air repr\u00e9sente un enjeu de sant\u00e9 publique majeur, en premier lieu dans les m\u00e9tropoles\u00a0: le transport routier y joue un r\u00f4le direct sur le niveau de pollution des territoires, impactant votre\u00a0sant\u00e9.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":6177,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[14],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6176"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6176"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6176\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":6631,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6176\/revisions\/6631"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/6177"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6176"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=6176"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-jso